# DUSKLING: 42 rooms, every one well formed (one way in, a way on or an
# egg, warps only where flowers grow). And the secrets are needed: with the
# stone faces asleep the route finder finds no way through the stone
# faces' room, and with the eyes still no way up to the amber egg.
game duskling
wait 5
expect room_errors == 0
cheat nerf 1
cheat solve 33 0 8000
expect solve_ok == 0
cheat nerf 8
cheat solve 28 4 8000
expect solve_ok == 0
cheat nerf 0
cheat solve 33 0 8000
expect solve_ok == 1
